# Analytics, proxied through this domain.
#
# Serving the counter and receiving its events from our own origin is what lets
# public/_headers keep `script-src 'self'` and `connect-src 'self'` — no
# third-party origin is ever contacted by the browser.
#
# TO TURN ON: replace pa-XXXXXXXX with the script id from the Plausible
# dashboard, then set `enabled: true` in src/config/analytics.ts.
#
# Netlify's Asset optimization (Bundle JS / Minify JS) must stay OFF, or it
# rewrites the script src to a CDN URL and the proxy silently breaks.

/js/script.js   https://plausible.io/js/pa-XXXXXXXX.js   200
/api/event      https://plausible.io/api/event           200
